<header class="review-hero">
<div class="container">
<div class="review-hero-content">
<div class="review-logo">
<img alt="Maket-Ai Logo" src="../../../assets/images/logos/maket-ai.png""/>
</div>
<div class="review-hero-info">
<div class="hero-badge"><span class="badge-icon">🏠</span><span>Residential Design</span></div>
<h1>Maket AI Review</h1>
<p class="company">Generative AI for Residential Floor Plans &amp; Design</p>
<div class="rating-large"><span class="stars">★★★★★</span><span class="score">4.8/5</span></div>
<div class="review-meta">
<div class="meta-item"><span><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><rect height="18" rx="2" ry="2" width="18" x="3" y="4"></rect><line x1="16" x2="16" y1="2" y2="6"></line><line x1="8" x2="8" y1="2" y2="6"></line><line x1="3" x2="21" y1="10" y2="10"></line></svg></span><span>Updated: November 2026</span></div>
<div class="meta-item"><span>⏱️</span><span>9 min read</span></div>
<div class="meta-item"><span><svg class="inline-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"></circle></svg></span><span>Residential Focus</span></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</header>
<div class="review-layout">
<main class="review-main">
<section class="review-section" id="overview">
<h2><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2"></path><rect height="4" rx="1" ry="1" width="8" x="8" y="2"></rect></svg> Overview</h2>
<p>Maket AI is a generative AI platform specifically designed for residential architectural design. Launched in 2023, it has rapidly become one of the most popular AI floor plan generators, with over 100,000 designs created. The platform focuses on making professional-quality residential design accessible to architects, builders, and property developers.</p>
<p>What makes Maket AI stand out is its incredible speed and ease of use. You can generate complete floor plans in seconds by simply entering basic parameters like lot size, number of bedrooms, and architectural style. The AI understands residential design conventions and generates layouts that are both aesthetically pleasing and functionally sound.</p>
<p>The platform has been particularly well-received by residential architects who need to quickly explore design options for client presentations, and by real estate developers looking to visualize different unit configurations. The quality of the AI-generated plans is impressive, often requiring minimal manual refinement.</p>
<div class="maket-highlight">
<h4><svg class="inline-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"></circle></svg> Instant Floor Plans</h4>
<p style="margin: 0;">Generate multiple complete residential floor plans in under 30 seconds. Each generation includes room layouts, furniture placement, and dimension suggestions.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section class="review-section" id="features">
<h2><svg class="inline-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"></polygon></svg> Key Features</h2>
<div class="features-grid">
<div class="feature-card"><h4><svg class="inline-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"></polygon></svg> Instant Floor Plans</h4><p>Generate complete residential floor plans in seconds based on your lot dimensions and program requirements. Multiple variations per generation.</p></div>
<div class="feature-card"><h4><svg class="inline-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2a10 10 0 017.38 16.75 2 2 0 01-3.5.54l-.9-1.34a2 2 0 00-1.65-.88H9.87a2 2 0 01-1.99-2.33L8.53 12a2 2 0 00-.26-1.5L6.8 8.53a10 10 0 015.2-6.53z"></path><circle cx="7.5" cy="10.5" r=".5"></circle><circle cx="18.5" cy="7.5" r=".5"></circle><circle cx="16.5" cy="13.5" r=".5"></circle></svg> Style Customization</h4><p>Choose from various architectural styles—modern, traditional, craftsman, Mediterranean, and more. AI adapts layouts to match style conventions.</p></div>
<div class="feature-card"><h4><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2"></path><rect height="4" rx="1" ry="1" width="8" x="8" y="2"></rect></svg> Zoning Compliance</h4><p>Input local zoning constraints like setbacks and height limits. AI generates designs that respect these regulatory requirements.</p></div>
<div class="feature-card"><h4>🛋️ Furniture Layout</h4><p>AI automatically places furniture to demonstrate how spaces will be used. Helps clients visualize room functionality and scale.</p></div>
<div class="feature-card"><h4>🧱 Material Suggestions</h4><p>Get AI-recommended material palettes that match your chosen architectural style. Includes finishes, colors, and textures.</p></div>
<div class="feature-card"><h4><svg class="neon-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="23 4 23 10 17 10"/><polyline points="1 20 1 14 7 14"/><path d="M3.51 9a9 9 0 0 1 14.85-3.36L23 10M1 14l4.64 4.36A9 9 0 0 0 20.49 15"/></svg> Design Variations</h4><p>Instantly generate alternative layouts based on the same constraints. Compare different approaches side-by-side.</p></div>
<div class="feature-card"><h4>📄 PDF Export</h4><p>Export floor plans as high-quality PDFs suitable for client presentations and preliminary submissions. Includes dimensions and room labels.</p></div>
<div class="feature-card"><h4><svg class="inline-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><rect height="14" rx="2" ry="2" width="20" x="2" y="7"></rect><path d="M16 21V5a2 2 0 00-2-2h-4a2 2 0 00-2 2v16"></path></svg> Commercial Licensing</h4><p>Paid plans include full commercial rights to AI-generated designs. Use them in client projects without restrictions.</p></div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="review-section" id="pros-cons">
<h2><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 15s1-1 4-1 5 2 8 2 4-1 4-1V3s-1 1-4 1-5-2-8-2-4 1-4 1z"></path><line x1="4" x2="4" y1="22" y2="15"></line></svg> Pros &amp; Cons</h2>
<div class="pros-cons-grid">
<div class="pros-card">
<h3><svg class="inline-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 11-5.93-9.14"></path><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"></polyline></svg> Advantages</h3>
<ul>
<li>Incredibly fast plan generation</li>
<li>Excellent residential design quality</li>
<li>Very intuitive interface</li>
<li>Great style variety</li>
<li>Furniture layout included</li>
<li>Zoning compliance features</li>
<li>Free trial available</li>
<li>Commercial licensing clear</li>
<li>Regular feature updates</li>
<li>Responsive customer support</li>
</ul>
</div>
<div class="cons-card">
<h3><svg class="inline-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><line x1="15" x2="9" y1="9" y2="15"></line><line x1="9" x2="15" y1="9" y2="15"></line></svg> Disadvantages</h3>
<ul>
<li>Residential-only focus</li>
<li>Limited 3D visualization</li>
<li>Export formats could be broader</li>
<li>No BIM integration yet</li>
<li>Cannot import existing plans</li>
<li>Parametric editing is limited</li>
<li>Some generated layouts need refinement</li>
<li>Monthly generation limits on lower tiers</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="review-section" id="pricing">
<h2><svg class="inline-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="1" y2="23"></line><path d="M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 000 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 010 7H6"></path></svg> Pricing</h2>
<p>Maket AI offers straightforward pricing with generous generation limits. All paid plans include commercial licensing rights.</p>
<div class="pricing-table">
<div class="pricing-tier">
<h4>Starter</h4>
<div class="price">Free</div>
<p style="color: var(--text-tertiary); font-size: var(--text-sm); margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);">Try before you buy</p>
<ul>
<li>3 floor plan generations</li>
<li>Basic style options</li>
<li>PDF export with watermark</li>
<li>Standard support</li>
<li>Personal use only</li>
</ul>
</div>
<div class="pricing-tier featured">
<h4>Professional</h4>
